        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Web of Fate"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divination, primal)\n\nThe suvarden creates a web spun from the threads of fate in a 10-foot burst within 30 feet. The squares filled with the web are difficult terrain. Each square can be cleared of the web by a single attack or effect that deals at least 5 slashing damage or 1 fire damage. A square has AC 5, and it automatically fails its saving throws. Each time a creature in the web begins to use a move action or enters the web during a move action, it must attempt a DC 25 Will save.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
